OL,3,GNEWSAPunters welcome return of horse
OL,4,Aracing to track
OL,5,
OL,6,FPunters at a racecourse's first meeting
OL,7,Fin several months said they were
OL,8,Fpleased to see it open again under new
OL,9,Fmanagement.
OL,11,FThere had been no events at Chelmsford
OL,12,FCity Racecourse since its previous
OL,13,Ftenant went into administration in
OL,14,FMarch with debts of more than #22m.
OL,16,FArena Racing Company (ARC) took over
OL,17,Fthe running of the track at Great
OL,18,FLeighs, north of Chelmsford, and an
OL,19,FAutumn Evening Flat Racing card was
OL,20,Fheld there on Monday night.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
