OL,3,GNEWSAPunters welcome return of horse
OL,4,Aracing to track
OL,5,
OL,6,FARC runs 16 other courses, and its
OL,7,Fchief executive Martin Cruddace said
OL,8,Fthe track was "economically viable" but
OL,9,Fa lot was riding on local support.
